{"id":"eeb525258b84dd0c","group":"88","path":"88/88-fact-tm-countable.md","title":"fact-tm-countable — Turing Machines are Countable","display":"fact-tm-countable — Turing Machines are Countable","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-fact-tm-countable","aliases":["88-fact-tm-countable"],"display":"fact-tm-countable — Turing Machines are Countable","depends_on":["[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[88-df-cardinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-fact-tm-countable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-fact-tm-countable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-tm-countable — Turing Machines are Countable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fb55f9cf4d73400\" href=\"?note=3fb55f9cf4d73400\" title=\"88-df-cardinality\">88-df-cardinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> (set of Turing machines, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}tm\\text{-}countable} \\vdash\n|\\mathrm{TM}|=\\omega\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}tm\\text{-}countable} \\vdash\n|\\mathrm{TM}|=\\omega\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> : 图灵机集合 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>)</li>\n<li>图灵机有有限描述，可编码为自然数；同时存在无限多个语法上不同的图灵机。</li>\n<li>可计算函数的编号理论</li>\n<li>递归论的基础事实</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"3fb55f9cf4d73400","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ (set of Turing machines, see [[88-df-turing-machine]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ : 图灵机集合 (see [[88-df-turing-machine]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}tm\\text{-}countable} \\vdash\n|\\mathrm{TM}|=\\omega","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false}],"bytes":761,"backlinks":[{"id":"dba31c144607e57b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-fact-tm-countable]] — 图灵机可数性"}],"outgoing":["e0bc676c7a4a4b11","3fb55f9cf4d73400"]}